== Usage in SMW Queries ==

=== Query All Properties by Category ===

<syntaxhighlight lang="mediawiki">
{{#ask:
  [[Category:SMW Property Definitions]]
  [[Has domain::Epistemology]]
  |?Has type
  |?Has description
  |format=table
}}
</syntaxhighlight>

=== Query by Property Type ===

<syntaxhighlight lang="mediawiki">
{{#ask:
  [[Has type::Number]]
  [[Category:SMW Property Definitions]]
  |format=list
}}
</syntaxhighlight>

